 "intro_zh": "平遥古城位于山西省中部平遥县内，1997年被列入世界文化遗产名录。平遥古城是中国汉民族城市在明清时期的杰出范例，在中国历史的发展中，为人们展示了一幅文化、社会、经济及宗教发展的完整画卷。",
 "intro_en": "Pingyao Ancient City is located in Pingyao County in central Shanxi Province. It was included in the World Cultural Heritage List in 1997. The ancient city of Pingyao is an outstanding example of Chinese Han ethnic cities in the Ming and Qing Dynasties. In the development of Chinese history, it shows people a complete picture of cultural, social, economic and religious development.",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
